      </p>

      <h2>1. Eligibility</h2>
      <p>
        You must be at least 13 years old to create an account. If you
        don't meet this requirement, do not use the Service.
      </p>
      <p>
        Access to wagering, side-game, and tournament-payout features is
        restricted to users who are at least 18 years old (or the age of
        legal majority in their jurisdiction) and legally permitted to
        participate in wagering activities where they live. By using
        those features, you represent that you meet both requirements.
      </p>
      <p>
        By creating an account, you represent that you meet the
        eligibility requirements above.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Your account</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>You're responsible for keeping your sign-in credentials secure. If you suspect someone else has gained access to your account, contact us at the address in §16 immediately.</li>
        <li>You're responsible for the activity that happens under your account, including any tournaments, bet games, and friends you create or join.</li>
        <li>We may suspend or terminate accounts that violate these Terms or put other users or the Service at risk. We'll give you notice where reasonably possible.</li>
        <li>You can delete your account at any time from <strong>Profile → Delete Account</strong>. Deleting your account revokes your access immediately. We may, but are not obligated to, delete your account data following deletion.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. Acceptable use</h2>
      <p>You agree NOT to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Use the Service to harass, defame, or threaten another user.</li>
        <li>Upload content that is illegal, abusive, hateful, or that violates someone else's intellectual property or privacy.</li>
        <li>Submit information you know to be false, including a fake handicap index or impersonating another player.</li>
        <li>Use the Service for illegal gambling. The Service is a scoring and bookkeeping tool; you are responsible for ensuring that any side games or tournament pots you participate in are lawful in your jurisdiction.</li>
        <li>Attempt to gain unauthorized access to other accounts, our backend, or our infrastructure.</li>
        <li>Use automated tools (scrapers, bots) to access the Service except as expressly allowed by us in writing.</li>
        <li>Reverse engineer, decompile, or attempt to extract source code from the Service except where the law expressly permits it.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>4. Your content</h2>
      <p>
        You own the data you enter into the Service: your scorecards, bet
        records, tournament results, profile information, and any photos
        or text you upload.
      </p>
      <p>
        By using the Service, you grant us a worldwide, non-exclusive,
        royalty-free, sublicensable, perpetual, and irrevocable license
