        <li>You may collect entry fees from your players. If you collect them yourself, outside the app, that is entirely between you and your players. If you use the card entry-fee feature where it is available to you, the money goes to your own Stripe account and refunds remain your responsibility — see §7.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>If you accept a tournament invite:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>You agree to the rules the organizer has configured for the tournament, including format, handicap allowances, and any side games they've enabled.</li>
        <li>You may withdraw from a tournament at any time before scoring starts; once scoring begins, withdrawals are subject to the organizer's rules.</li>
      </ul>

